  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
  "label": "The visual of people raising hands is mapped onto the textual command to identify racists.",
  "description": "The text 'hands up all racists who support white genocide' directly commands the visual action of people raising their hands. This creates an analogical mapping where the gesture of raising hands (a visual material entity) is being used as a metaphorical or literal mechanism to identify and target individuals based on their race and alleged support for a false conspiracy theory. The visual of collective hand-raising, typically associated with compliance or participation, is being repurposed to signify the act of 'naming' or 'flagging' people as racists, thereby creating a jarring and manipulative contrast between the passive visual and the hateful textual message.",
